<title>USA: Merisel names McInerney president, COO.</title>
<headline>Merisel names McInerney president, COO.</headline>
<dateline>EL SEGUNDO, Calif. 1997-02-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Merisel Inc said Robert McInerney was named president and chief operating officer, effective immediately.</p>
<p>He replaces ronald Rittenmeyer, who resigned last September.</p>
<p>McInerney previously was executive vice president of United Capital Corp, a multinational holding company in Great Neck, New York.</p>
